<view class="shell"><navigation-bar title="数据管理" back="{{true}}"></navigation-bar><scroll-view class="page-scroll" scroll-y enhanced show-scrollbar="{{false}}"><view class="content"><view class="notice-card card"><view class="notice-title">本地数据</view><view class="notice-desc">阶段3数据只保存在当前微信环境，不上传服务器，也不保存工具输入、图片或视频文件。</view><view class="summary-row"><text>收藏 {{summary.favorites}}</text><text>浏览 {{summary.history}}</text><text>最近使用 {{summary.recent}}</text></view></view><view class="action-list card"><view wx:for="{{actions}}" wx:key="id" class="action-row {{index === actions.length - 1 ? 'is-last' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onActionTap"><view class="action-copy"><view class="action-title {{item.danger ? 'is-danger' : ''}}">{{item.title}}</view><view class="action-desc">{{item.desc}}</view></view><t-icon name="chevron-right" size="28rpx" color="#94a0a5" /></view></view><view class="foot-note">微信清理缓存、移除小程序或系统清理数据后，本地数据可能丢失；当前版本不提供跨设备同步。</view></view></scroll-view></view>
